    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Alaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng bar múk yaamuudá' ni kuungií haniisi ngwaa hhaamiís, nee alaá bar kuungá' yaamuuín iga alé', nee tari hotaá eeré' baraá maray'ín, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní kuungá' gixsadaá tám ki paratlá' baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ni kuungá' i haniisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' loohi an tlehhá' nee yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng na kuungá' i haniisi as tawa aalirhúng, kiri qasisá' baraá daqooroó tám as umuú heewo oo hee gwaa pa/aayór wa gaas iwa gowi amoodií ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee barnaxes hee gwa pa/aayór wá gaás, heé wakusmowoseeká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ar slaqse, hee nee kuqá' ta xaa'aá tlaquú áy baraá darma, qoomár iwa tlaaqi, tsawo iri gawaá kipáy wa kotsoqót, hee guri /ák, iri gwaá', heedaádá' tsawoorós hee gwaa gas i gowi amór gixsár wák baraá gixsaduudá' taa paraatli, as slafiingós nguwa tu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes gixsadá' ka ló'wa saaw, heedaádá' li/oó bu'uúm kudá' hee gwaa pa/aayór wa gaas gu aleeslay eeharto guri gaas, tam heedaádá' hee gwaa pa/aayór wa gaas kwasleemarós kaa gwa'arárií tsatiikahe, asma inooín aáng a wakuuseerooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, aníng kuungá' nun baw, gixsadaá tám paraatlaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slám barnaxes AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng digeemaá yaamuuhúng ngaa doók, adoodá' ngira dír baabi'iihúng i alqadín, nee inós yaamu sleémeero kudá' aa al'axweés dír baabi'iihúng, ngiwa haniisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barnaxes kuungá' taa ló'wa harmagahhé' hara'ayaarí laarí naa kuungá' báw kawa ota', nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuri slaé', nee deelo sleémeero loohirós baraá eehadé', daqaní kuungá' gixsadaá hatlá' awa tám i dogá' dír kudaá geera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as heé dakuúsár koomaaká mukuwa gaás baraá ayaahúng kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ni dír kuungá' i haniisi, nee gawaá adoorihe kuungá' nuri dakuúsár tsu/utár áy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala barnaxes hee wakusmoowós gwaa haramamahhaát guri gaás, aluuwo iri goów baraá gixsaduudaá guwaay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bariisér gixsadá' muu ngu ya/ap, as heedaádá' kuwa baraadá' wa duuxi, kuri haniis dír kudá' li/oó bu'uúm daanduú heedá' aa gaás wa alé, as kuwa gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé adoorí mu baloó gurtlawaara', ala masók tlakweemaá tsu/utár múk dakuusár koomaaká baraá yaamaá Israeliro in faká' as kuungá' tawa hota' ar wayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Digeemaá aáng awa yaamaá inslaawayhúng kudá' taa qaás mi hingeemisaara', baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ni kuungá' i haniisi as kiwa ala'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Lamabu'úngw heé wák i bu'uutiiká kuwa heéwár sakwasleemut daanduú dakuúsár hee gaasaro, laqaá tlakweemaá hatlá' awa aa tleéhh. Lamabu'úngw múk tsár, laqaá tám, an lamabu'úngw bu'uút kuwa ar gadiyusa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes lamabu'usmoó lamusmo hee gwaa sakwasleemuút dakuúsarkaaro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inós nee heesíng kaa/uusá' ta sihhiiti dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, dír geeraá kaahamuusér Mungú nee har'ohuuse, kudá' qoomaasinge baraá gadiyeédí diriiá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Har'ohuuse gilaadá' giri alqaytsít, bar lamabu'usmoodá' a lamusmo, nee heedaádá' guna hara/uuntsín, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagáy kwasleemaadá' ka tsatá' adoodá' lamabu'usmoodá' geeraawo heedaádá' ngu laqtá wa slai, ka inósí tleehhi. Adoorí an adoodá' tlakweema kir hingeesa' baraá tla/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk hatlá' adoorí birnga axaás tari da'ayuut, nee tlakweemaá adór kuká' kiri male tleehhiiká tla/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk adór kwí mu gurtlawaara'. Heé hee gwa gaas, aqo inós kun gaas sleeme, heé iltá hee gaa gaas, aqo iltós kan gaas sleeme, heé sihhnoó hee gwa tuu/, aqo inós kun sihhno tuu/ sleeme, heé dákw hee gwa geeqay, aqo inós kun dawa geeqáy sleeme, heé yaaér hee gaa geeqay, aqo inós kun yaae geeqáy sleeme.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
